Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）春人，我出门了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于到决赛了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.77,0:00:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还剩两个人，我一定要把你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！快斗大人！快斗大人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会让你妨碍我直到将所有 No.卡猎尽为止。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.33,0:00:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}半决赛第一轮，令人震惊的黑马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马取得了胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）小猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.43,0:00:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，与这位九十九游马在决赛中对战的会是谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}半决赛第二轮将由这两人来对决！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}经历一切不明。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然现身的灰姑娘男孩。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.19,0:00:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然而 这份实力货真价实。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其名为 托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迎战他的是这位年轻人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}孤高而至于至高！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见过他败北的人 至今仍未出现。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.56,0:01:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真可谓是天才！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.27,0:01:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其名为 天城快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 拜托你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要把托隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那个男人打倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.48,0:01:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不许输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想和你一战。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.97,0:01:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟我们还没分出胜负呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.39,0:01:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚哇！ 星光体？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决赛等着吧，你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.59,0:02:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎，你说了“你们”？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“你们”！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）来吧，演员都到齐了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将两位勇者引领至天空的场地吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿，在体育场那种地方哪看得下去啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}疼！笨蛋蠢货！你干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，想看就看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看我压倒性的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，获胜的究竟是快斗还是托隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.73,0:04:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世纪对决的钟声，此刻{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正要高声敲响。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心在燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，加油啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.78,0:04:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人，请您保重身体。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么好笑的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}何止是好笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我正因欢喜而颤抖啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈……我感觉得到叛徒的视线。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）哈哈哈……就让你见识一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最棒的瞬间吧，菲卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（菲卡博士）托隆……不，拜隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到你竟然变成了那副模样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}苟活至今。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凡是阻挡我野心的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是谁都给我粉碎掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆，我不会忘记的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你对遥人做的那些事。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了遥人，我也要葬送你！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啦好啦，别那么生气嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之后会有让你大吃一惊的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乐子在等着你呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}废话少说。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，决斗模式，光子转换！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻由我来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤光子粉碎者！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再装备魔法卡 光子长矛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.55,0:06:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备到光子粉碎者上！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子长矛只能装备在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子怪兽上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽可以作为
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只份量的解放素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.13,0:06:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2000的怪兽有两只！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.87,0:06:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2000的光子粉碎者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将2只解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）在黑暗中闪耀的银河啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化作希望之光寄宿于我的仆从吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.65,0:06:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之化身 在此降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:06:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗…？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 我盖放1张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 你光是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用 No.夺走人的灵魂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就已经很痛了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经站不住了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遍体鳞伤了吧。呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽如此保健室可不行哦。呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.27,0:07:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.51,0:07:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗他没事吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.51,0:07:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃…那个…这个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤纹章兽 蛇怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动装备魔法 爆裂勋章…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备给银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把装备魔法装到对方怪兽身上！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用纹章兽 蛇怪攻击银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蛇怪的攻击力是1000。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能打得过3000的银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵…蛇怪在战斗的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会拉着对方怪兽同归于尽拥有破坏的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，装备了爆裂勋章
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的怪兽被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其控制者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会受到被破坏怪兽攻击力一半的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（众人）哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:08:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，蛇怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗期间，可以将银河眼和对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用银河眼的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将双方的怪兽除外，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把爆裂勋章卸下来了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不愧是你，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回到场地上吧！银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真有你的。都伤成那样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是为了可爱的弟弟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是件好事呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有目标这件事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也有哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向你父亲复仇。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被Ｄｒ．Ｆａｋｅｒ背叛{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在异世界的夹缝中徘徊的缘故{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的身体变成了这副模样。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错　我啊　把一切都失去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变得一无所有。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库库库库…　哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以啊　唯独这个我一直珍重地守护着。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.77,0:10:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是向你父亲的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.57,0:10:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇就是我的一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇？　就为了这个　Ｖ…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的儿子会牺牲的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.66,0:10:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！你在指责我？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:10:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太奇怪了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不也是为了弟弟在猎取灵魂吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然是为了弟弟才做的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是不知何时猎取灵魂的喜悦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你感受到了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.29,0:11:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你很像啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了目的会牺牲一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能让哈鲁特得救
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管你说什么我都无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那腐烂的灵魂我来猎取！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.95,0:11:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要亲手捏碎它！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤光子卫星！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子怪兽等级提升后召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此　光子卫星的等级变为９！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且　光子卫星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:11:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材的场合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.52,0:12:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１只可以当作２只！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用　当作２只的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子卫星　进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.93,0:12:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}讽刺的命运啊　下令吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Ｖ！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.63,0:12:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不　将克里斯的意志化为铁锤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向愚蠢的父亲砸下！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！　No.９！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.13,0:12:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）天盖星 戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.05,0:13:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……你。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V的意志……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戴森球。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 托隆！ 我 将装备魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子之翼装备给银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动装备的光子之翼的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次 选择我方场上的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 选择戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将戴森球的全部超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过装备了光子之翼的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼吸收{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 其攻击力上升选择的怪兽的阶级
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乘以200点！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那……那样的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:13:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）戴森球的阶级是 9！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 上升1800！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 通过使用了光子之翼的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼可以进行直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力4800的直接攻击啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.03,0:14:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太猛了 一击就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就定了 快斗大人可以休养了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对托隆进行直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.47,0:14:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 好厉害……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）呵呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵……！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么…… 为什么生命值……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为 为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明吃了4800的直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.95,0:15:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 变更徽章！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将等级4以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.75,0:15:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章怪兽特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗伤害按那只怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.43,0:15:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级×1000点无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 4000的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被减轻了是吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～ 太卑鄙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！ 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你开心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.41,0:15:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.28,0:15:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我再让你更开心一点吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我送给你的礼物。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.89,0:15:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是哥哥的错。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.91,0:16:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明说好了会治好我的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可结果呢却让我遭这种罪。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特的脸……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想干什么！ 拜伦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）至今为止 你那无聊的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.90,0:16:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胡言乱语我都听过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我自认为已经算是陪你玩过了 但是…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.65,0:16:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种侮辱我绝不容忍！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生气了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是呢 我就是哈鲁特哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别冒充哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是冒充哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就是 哈鲁特哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特 就是我哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）你看 就是绑架哈鲁特的时候哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个时候 在我的身体里把哈鲁特的力量和记忆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都吸收掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:17:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个时候呢 交融了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼此空虚的心与心。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和哈鲁特的意识连接在一起了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 要是做了这种事。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.81,0:17:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哈鲁特）呜 呜呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.52,0:17:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}派人去哈鲁特的房间！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 快！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}系统被切断了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}门打不开！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么… 是那家伙干的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛啊 好痛啊哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜 呜呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！ 你这家伙真的和哈鲁特
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连接在一起了吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 我就是哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼 哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）不行哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不能让你到遥斗那里去。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我去遥斗那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会保护遥斗的现在 集中精力决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.47,0:18:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道7！\
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.60,0:18:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个精神的孩子。 呵呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.07,0:18:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 继续吧 决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.07,0:18:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的阿巴科恩威和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.52,0:18:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蛇怪进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.8。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章王 基因组继承者！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是托隆的 No.……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动纹章王 基因组继承者的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从3个效果中选择1个发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择的是，直到回合结束{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.23,0:19:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与这张卡战斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击力变成零{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将其原本的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成基因组继承者的攻击力的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然夺走攻击力！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要攻击戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.59,0:19:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，戴森球的攻击力变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的基因组继承者攻击力变成2800！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，对戴森球是行不通的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对没有超量素材的戴森球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地复活超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.85,0:20:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使所有攻击无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.05,0:20:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了！我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用第二个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.59,0:20:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择下一个效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到回合结束将对方怪兽的效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那个效果作为基因组遗传的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.51,0:20:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次连戴森球的效果都……！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就能攻击戴森球了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 基因组遗传！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.19,0:21:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 接下来才是 好戏这才是真本事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.91,0:21:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 我们的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份冲击会化为真实袭向肉体。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 袭向我的冲击……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.77,0:21:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃…… 呜呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.44,0:21:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧……！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.74,0:21:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。 哥哥你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不得不把我当作对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.22,0:21:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和哈鲁特…… 战斗！？ 开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.69,0:21:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来 是哥哥的回合哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个人 一起享受吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特 等着我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.57,0:21:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会救你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.17,0:21:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆……！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完美 这样一来 费卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在你眼前竟然把两个儿子都……。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵……都给毁掉了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.36,0:22:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.63,0:22:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.55,0:24:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次是鲨鱼使用的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.07,0:24:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.32 鲨鱼·龙·恶鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.24,0:24:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会彻底地将对手吞噬殆尽的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.41,0:24:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛 盯着我看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.99,0:24:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看起来 没什么嚼头啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.79,0:24:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是打算让我吃吗！

